, based on any act, fact, event or omission or other matter, cause or thing occurring at any time prior to or on the date hereof in any way, directly or indirectly arising out of, connected with or relating to the Existing Credit Agreement or any other Financing Document and the transactions contemplated thereby, and all other agreements, certificates, instruments and other documents and statements (whether written or oral) related to any of the foregoing (each, a “Claim” and collectively, the “Claims”). Each Releasing Party further represents that it has not sold or assigned any Claim and stipulates and agrees with respect to all Claims, that it hereby waives, to the fullest extent permitted by applicable Law, any and all provisions, rights, and benefits conferred by any Applicable Law, any applicable foreign Law or","context":"Section 7. Release; Waiver.","section":"","block":35,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-097350","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-14","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001839530","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1839530/000110465926097350/xbp-20260630xex10d1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/a1c0fdb2326f080b1ff8afde6915582f4266d174a410fcd0597a1c99a5de4a65.bin","sha256":"a1c0fdb2326f080b1ff8afde6915582f4266d174a410fcd0597a1c99a5de4a65"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"managementExplanations":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"materialEvents":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"572d9d1723b1bdf085f68a8a87e4986b3a3076b020c273daf417e4765a2be9ce","quote":"This FIFTH AMENDMENT TO CREDIT AND SECURITY AGREEMENT (this “Amendment”), dated as of May 14, 2026, is entered into by and among XBP Americas, LLC (formerly known as Exela Technologies BPA, LLC) a Delaware limited liability company, (the “Borrower”), the guarantors party thereto (the “Guarantors”), MIDCAP FUNDING IV TRUST, a Delaware statutory t